      termsIntro:'These terms explain both your responsibilities and Koneksyon’s commitments to you as an ambassador. By applying or continuing in the program, you confirm you are at least 18 and agree to the current rules. Nothing in these terms removes rights that cannot legally be waived.',
      t1Title:'1. Eligibility, approval and relationship', t1Body:'You must be at least 18 and approved by Koneksyon. Approval is not guaranteed. The program is intended as an independent referral and marketing arrangement, not a promise of employment, partnership, or agency, subject to any non-waivable rights you may have under applicable law.',
      t2Title:'2. Campaign transparency and your agreed rate', t2Body:'Before you promote, your portal will show the campaign target, total reward, dates, payout threshold, and effective rate per qualified user. Koneksyon will not retroactively lower the rate for referrals that already became qualified under that campaign. A different rate or target may apply only to future activity after notice or a new campaign is assigned.',
      t3Title:'3. What counts as a qualified referral', t3Body:'A qualified referral must be a new Koneksyon user attributed to your assigned link or QR code, who completes registration, passes required approval or verification, and is accepted as a legitimate unique account. Existing users, duplicate or fake accounts, incomplete or rejected registrations, self-referrals, manipulated device activity, bots, or fraudulent registrations do not count.',
      t4Title:'4. Follow the law and disclose that you are paid', t4Body:'You must follow advertising, privacy, anti-spam, consumer-protection, platform, and other laws that apply where you promote. For promotions that reach U.S. consumers, clearly and conspicuously disclose your paid relationship with Koneksyon in the same language as the promotion, for example “Paid Koneksyon Ambassador,” “#ad,” or “#sponsored,” where people can easily see it. Do not make deceptive claims, send unlawful spam, harass people, or intentionally recruit anyone under 18 for Koneksyon.',
      t5Title:'5. Earnings, 100-user threshold and 14-day payout periods', t5Body:'Your first payout becomes eligible after at least 100 qualified users. If you are below 100, legitimate qualified activity rolls forward instead of disappearing. After the threshold is reached, eligible unpaid referrals are processed in 14-day payout periods at the campaign rate. When a campaign ends, legitimate unpaid qualified referrals remain eligible for a final review and payout; they are not automatically forfeited because the campaign ended.',
      t6Title:'6. USD payment methods and payment reference', t6Body:'All ambassador earnings are calculated in U.S. dollars. Supported methods are Cash App, Zelle, MoneyGram, and USD bank transfer to a USD account at Unibank, Capital Bank, Banque de L’Union Haitienne, Sogebel, or Sogebank. After Koneksyon records a payout as paid, your portal will show the payment reference number supplied by the payment provider or bank. Third-party transfer, intermediary, or receiving-bank fees may apply.',
      t7Title:'7. Ambassador protections and Koneksyon commitments', t7Body:'Koneksyon will use the campaign rules shown in your portal to calculate eligible earnings, will not cancel legitimate earned amounts solely because you stop promoting or the relationship ends, and will keep your private payment details restricted to authorized processing. Koneksyon will not retaliate against an ambassador for raising a good-faith payment or referral dispute. If a verified system or accounting error affected your balance, Koneksyon will correct it.',
      t8Title:'8. Fraud review, holds and your right to request review', t8Body:'Koneksyon may investigate suspicious referrals and may hold, reject, reverse, or remove activity supported by evidence of duplicates, fabricated registrations, bans, abuse, or fraud. A hold is not automatically a forfeiture. You may request a review through support@koneksyondatingapp.com if you believe a referral or payout decision is incorrect. Koneksyon will review the available records in good faith and, where security and law permit, explain the outcome or the general reason for the decision.',
      t9Title:'9. Privacy, brand use and your content', t9Body:'Your dashboard shows aggregate campaign information and does not reveal private referred-member data. You must not collect or misuse member data. Koneksyon gives you a limited, revocable right to use approved Koneksyon branding only for authorized ambassador promotion. You keep ownership of your pre-existing and original content; participation alone does not transfer ownership of that content to Koneksyon. Any broader paid usage rights should be agreed separately or stated in a specific campaign.',
      t10Title:'10. Taxes, changes, termination and non-waivable rights', t10Body:'You are responsible for taxes and payment-provider requirements that legally apply to you. Koneksyon may update program rules, but material changes may require renewed acceptance and do not retroactively erase legitimate amounts already earned under an earlier campaign. Koneksyon may suspend or terminate participation for violations or risk concerns, but legitimate unpaid qualified earnings remain subject to normal verification and lawful withholding requirements. These terms do not waive rights that applicable law says cannot be waived.'
